# Implementation Planning

1. Read existing conventions and the code paths you will touch.
2. State assumptions; ask when an answer changes the design.
3. Order the work so each step leaves the project building and tested.
4. Give each step a verification command.
5. Define observable acceptance criteria and a rollback.
